#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:3
#: 5ff8dd9fcb894d39829dc38b1ce3eb0f
msgid "设置磁矩（Set Magnetic Moments）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:5
#: 7fa2f45f985a463daed58e64ee4de68f
msgid "`Group`: `Magnetism` | `Class`: `SetMagneticMomentsCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:7
#: 07f5156de6f745c5ae8cff7e20788424
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:9
#: dd6b30f37c78428ab70f9c65840fa087
msgid ""
"把输入结构写成统一的 `initial_magmoms` 表示。选择磁矩来源（已有磁矩 / 元素映射 / 常数幅值）、输出格式（标量 / "
"向量）、参考轴方向和生效元素范围。这是一张基础层卡片——不生成多磁序分支，只为后续磁性卡片提供干净、统一的初始磁矩。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:11
#: a434d619b7884ec693e69b8bb7d6abd7
msgid ""
"**和 `Magnetic Order` 的区别：** `Magnetic Order` 从一个母相出发生成 FM+AFM+PM "
"多分支。本卡只标准化磁矩格式，不创建新磁序。如果你的流程里多张磁性卡都在重复配 `magmom_map` 和 "
"`axis`，用本卡统一初始化一次可以消除重复。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:13
#: 781945e218664a3db4d9987a6b91c0ee
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:15
#: 642952ae3bfa40c08978e9f50b93f28f
msgid "场景：多张磁性卡各自配 magmom_map，配错了一处"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:17
#: 55f73ec7c80c4ffa8f60d04984b1e16a
msgid ""
"你的训练流水线里有 `Magnetic Order` → `Small-Angle Spin Tilt` → `Spin Spiral` "
"三张磁性卡。每张卡都有一个 `magmom_map` 输入框，你填了三遍 `Fe:2.2,Co:1.7`。两周后改 Co 的磁矩为 "
"1.5，只改了两张卡，第三张忘了——生成的数据里 Co 的磁矩默默用了旧值。训练出来的模型在含 Co 的构型上能量系统性偏高。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:19
#: 9a81832c133b40a49a556229b41df28c
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 磁性流水线里，磁矩幅值的定义应该只在一处。用本卡在最前面做一次统一初始化，后续磁性卡全部选 \"Existing "
"initial magmoms\" 模式，不再各自定义 magmom_map。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:21
#: 6b8798a1ef8847c3b64384c5b3dd7072
msgid "**输入：** 一个磁性晶体结构，还没写 `initial_magmoms`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:23
#: 45e4220ffe3640a28884cc01468dd163
msgid "**目标：** 统一写入向量格式的初始磁矩，Fe 取 2.2 μB，Co 取 1.7 μB，沿 z 轴，后续卡片全部复用"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:25
#: 6a11bea9da3c4de8ad4b3e033bfc7c66
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:26
#: b6e94063a3f94276ab17d81623173f71
msgid "`Source` = `Map/default magnitude`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:27
#: 23d60aa40ec8441c8f65986c83d12936
msgid "`Format` = `Non-collinear (vector)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:28
#: 6acb6521a4b24ef2ae4bddf118da8a89
msgid "`Magmom Map` = `Fe:2.2,Co:1.7`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:29
#: c82b6e25e40845dcaf63214016a1fa20
msgid "`Apply Elements` = `Fe,Co`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:31
#: ddb686d42c264182be7c0b2a84246ec9
msgid "**输出：** 1 个结构，带 `MagSet(map,vec)` 标签和 `initial_magmoms` 数组。原子位置和数量不变。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:33
#: 4ffd8183841d485995e9d137978db290
