#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:34
#: 5f5f97988ce845d7936ed2f54beee5cc
msgid "后续磁性卡全部切到 \"Existing initial magmoms\"，检查输出磁矩幅值是否一致"
